  "largeProjectMethod": "Same existing workloads and data on one Mac, serial processes after tests/builds. Three pairs of versions per project, order reversed in the second pair. Each version runs native and combined with equivalent scheduling and semantic budgets unlimited, six body edits and 15 states. Startup is process launch to first hover; first and continuous latencies are didChange to hover and to matching edited-file diagnostics. Continuous median covers body-2 through body-6. Memory is lifetime maximum physical footprint at sample boundaries. Filesystem caches may be warm. Each run compares complete public diagnostics and hover at every state against native.",
