    "Ordinary file URI construction took 80 ns versus 521 ns before in the dedicated real-path benchmark, about 6.5x faster. The escaped-path corpus also preserved its throughput.",
    "In three full real-project pairs, combined structural diagnostic medians improved by 11.725 ms for CVA6 and 9.142 ms for USBDEV. The OpenTitan SoC full-run median increased by 2.107 ms; paired changes varied from -13.179 to +20.442 ms.",
